<gpx version="1.1" creator="galicica.finereli.com" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1" xmlns:gpxx="http://www.garmin.com/xmlschemas/GpxExtensions/v3" xmlns:gpx_style="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/gpx_style/0/2">
<metadata><name>Oteshevo - Goga peak - Sharbojca mountain house</name><desc>You cross the eastern and central parts of the mountain, with steady climbs and a strongly sporty character. The ground is mostly hard and stony, with soft grass in parts of the karst fields. In its lower half the path is in dense tall forest, easy to walk, though in places there are big fallen trunks across it. For most of the way the trail is clear and, in good visibility, easy to follow. https://galicica.finereli.com/routes/oteshevo-goga-sharbojca/</desc><link href="https://galicica.finereli.com/"><text>galicica.finereli.com</text></link><copyright author="NP Galičica (trail lines), OpenStreetMap contributors (places, G-6)"><license>https://galicica.finereli.com/about/#license</license></copyright></metadata>
<wpt lat="40.985027" lon="20.918126"><name>Start: Oteshevo</name><desc>Oteshevo to Sharbojca mountain house: 23.4 km, 9 h 45 min, very hard</desc><sym>Trail Head</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="41.027220" lon="20.865550"><name>Start: Sharbojca mountain house</name><desc>Sharbojca mountain house to Oteshevo: 23.4 km, 5 h 45 min, hard</desc><sym>Trail Head</sym></wpt>
<trk><name>MTB-3: the MTB-2 junction to the MTB-2 junction</name><desc>MTB-3 is one of Galičica National Park's mountain bike trails, some of them handy links between hiking routes. It's 7.3 km from the MTB-2 junction to the MTB-2 junction, with about 145 m of climbing and 152 m of descent in the direction drawn, between 1,438 m and 1,559 m.</desc><type>MTB</type><extensions><gpxx:TrackExtension><gpxx:DisplayColor>DarkBlue</gpxx:DisplayColor></gpxx:TrackExtension><gpx_style:line><gpx_style:color>24357F</gpx_style:color><gpx_style:width>4</gpx_style:width></gpx_style:line></extensions><trkseg><trkpt lat="41.049274" lon="20.858220"><ele>1447</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.049068" lon="20.859504"><ele>1454</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.049590" lon="20.861436"><ele>1453</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.049502" lon="20.862951"><ele>1464</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.049701" lon="20.864000"><ele>1468</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.050428" lon="20.865061"><ele>1481</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.050471" lon="20.867169"><ele>1509</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.051105" lon="20.868431"><ele>1526</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.050942" lon="20.869562"><ele>1542</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.050461" lon="20.870042"><ele>1556</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.051039" lon="20.870328"><ele>1552</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.051136" lon="20.870658"><ele>1554</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.050896" lon="20.871733"><ele>1547</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.050821" lon="20.873641"><ele>1545</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.051332" lon="20.875919"><ele>1550</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.051293" lon="20.876593"><ele>1552</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.051577" lon="20.877561"><ele>1558</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.051635" lon="20.877553"><ele>1559</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.051816" lon="20.877887"><ele>1557</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.052145" lon="20.878107"><ele>1556</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.052072" lon="20.878274"><ele>1552</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.051771" lon="20.878463"><ele>1543</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.051325" lon="20.878619